<TR>
<TD bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign=top>&nbsp;</td>
<TD bgcolor="#cccccc" valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Arial"><B>
<A HREF="http://www.eqrealm.com/cgi-bin/ubb/forumdisplay.cgi?action=topics&forum=Monk&number=6&DaysPrune=10&LastLogin=">Monk</A></B></FONT><BR>
<FONT SIZE="1" FACE="Arial">
Monks are dedicated to the pursuit of shaping their bodies into a pure weapon, and because of this they nearly shun all weapons and most forms of armor. They are very religious as well, and the gods are known to bless them, not by prayers and spells, but by magically enhancing their attacks.
</FONT>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#a8a8a8" align=center valign=top NOWRAP>
