<FONT SIZE='2' FACE="Arial">&nbsp;</FONT></td></tr>
<TR>
<TD bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign=top>&nbsp;</td>
<TD bgcolor="#cccccc" valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Arial"><B>
<A HREF="http://www.eqrealm.com/cgi-bin/ubb/forumdisplay.cgi?action=topics&forum=Necromancer&number=7&DaysPrune=10&LastLogin=">Necromancer</A></B></FONT><BR>
<FONT SIZE="1" FACE="Arial">
These are the dark brotherhood of the arcane arts, dabbling in death. Through evil spiritually based spells, they are able to animate dead bodies and skeletons to do their bidding, as well as having spells which leach life from their victims.
</FONT>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#a8a8a8" align=center valign=top NOWRAP>
